Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Revert or remove Cleanroom as a whole

Cleanroom replaces the net.minecraftforge component with a custom
patch, so the regular Revert would look for a Forge version that
doesn't exist, and Remove would leave its LWJGL 3 and stub jars behind.

Revert now replaces Cleanroom with the recommended regular Forge for the
Minecraft version, and Remove takes out Cleanroom, its LWJGL 3 and its
stub jars; Minecraft's LWJGL 2 comes back on the next resolve. Removing
Cleanroom's LWJGL 3 on its own is refused, and automatic Java selection
picks a matching Java again afterwards.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013JsFfD4B8pB33N2PvMGY8s
